-- A conversation's attachment row may now be a file a developer's line carried (`models/line-files.ts`): a PDF or a text file has no size in pixels, so the check asks for the size whole or not at all rather than always. Every row standing already holds both, so the new check is a looser one and validates at once. Idempotent: dropped where it stands, then added again in one statement.
ALTER TABLE "attachment" DROP CONSTRAINT IF EXISTS "attachment_conversation_picture", ADD CONSTRAINT "attachment_conversation_picture" CHECK ("conversation_id" is null or ("sha256" is not null and ("width" is null) = ("height" is null)));
